{
  "slug": "laravel-ai-starter",
  "name": "Laravel Ai Starter",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Laravel AI Starter creates new Laravel projects fully configured for AI-assisted development. One command sets up Laravel + Livewire + Pest with Boost, Larastan, IDE Helper, Debugbar, coding guidelines, and optional features like VitePress documentation, login, OpenAI, Filament admin panel, and Stripe payments. Ready to code in minutes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `new-laravel-project` (Create a new Laravel project fully configured for AI-assisted development with Boost, Claude Code, Codex, guidelines, and Pint).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install laravel-ai-starter@claude-community` from `maj0rr/laravel-ai-starter`.",
